    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   ...I've reached the destination.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "...I've reached the destination."
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   No other abnormalities found.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "No other abnormalities found."
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   Report complete.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "Report complete."
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_219_meteo_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   Frostleaf, why were you frowning the whole way here?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "Frostleaf, why were you frowning the whole way here?"
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_193_frostl_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[name=\"Frostleaf\"]   I'm just a little concerned about Amiya's group.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Frostleaf",
        "content": "I'm just a little concerned about Amiya's group."
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_219_meteo_1\" )]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   They've already safely returned to Rhodes Island.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "They've already safely returned to Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   Nearl and Dobermann already left Lungmen a week ago for their next assignment.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "Nearl and Dobermann already left Lungmen a week ago for their next assignment."
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   It must be a pretty tough mission if it required sending those two together.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "It must be a pretty tough mission if it required sending those two together."
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   Blacksteel and Penguin Logistics both have their own matters to attend to.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "Blacksteel and Penguin Logistics both have their own matters to attend to."
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_259_Jessica_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"Jessica\"]   Oh, Liskarm and Franka...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Jessica",
        "content": "Oh, Liskarm and Franka..."
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[name=\"Jessica\"]   I'm... I'm glad that they're safe...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Jessica",
        "content": "I'm... I'm glad that they're safe..."
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_259_Jessica_1\", name2=\"char_219_meteo_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1.png",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   You've got to work hard as well, just like them.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "You've got to work hard as well, just like them."
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   When Franka sent you over to me, she spoke very highly of you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "When Franka sent you over to me, she spoke very highly of you."
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_259_Jessica_1\", name2=\"char_219_meteo_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1.png",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"Jessica\"]   R-really...?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Jessica",
        "content": "R-really...?"
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_259_Jessica_1\", name2=\"char_219_meteo_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1.png",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   If only you weren't so timid, she said.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "If only you weren't so timid, she said."
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_259_Jessica_1#4\", name2=\"char_219_meteo_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#4.png",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[name=\"Jessica\"]   Uuu....",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Jessica",
        "content": "Uuu...."
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_259_Jessica_1#4\", name2=\"char_219_meteo_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#4.png",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   ...Hey, don't act like you're about to start crying!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "...Hey, don't act like you're about to start crying!"
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   Aren't you also a member of Blacksteel...?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "Aren't you also a member of Blacksteel...?"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_259_Jessica_1#5\", name2=\"char_219_meteo_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"Jessica\"]   I, I'm not... crying...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Jessica",
        "content": "I, I'm not... crying..."
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_219_meteo_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   ...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   ...In any case, let's continue our mission.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "...In any case, let's continue our mission."
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   Our next task is to work with the other recon teams to scout out this entire city.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "Our next task is to work with the other recon teams to scout out this entire city."
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   Other than searching for survivors, we also need to assess the situation.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "Other than searching for survivors, we also need to assess the situation."
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   If we encounter hostile Infected, we'll have to deal with the threat quickly.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "If we encounter hostile Infected, we'll have to deal with the threat quickly."
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   Even though our mission isn't particularly dangerous, it's still best to proceed with caution.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "Even though our mission isn't particularly dangerous, it's still best to proceed with caution."
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   In the event that Reunion is involved in this, we'll retreat immediately and report back to Dr. Kal'tsit.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "In the event that Reunion is involved in this, we'll retreat immediately and report back to Dr. Kal'tsit."
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_259_Jessica_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"Jessica\"]   Mmhm, mmhm!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Jessica",
        "content": "Mmhm, mmhm!"
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_193_frostl_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"Frostleaf\"]   Understood.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Frostleaf",
        "content": "Understood."
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_219_meteo_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[name=\"Meteorite\"]   All that's left for us to do... is to focus on our job.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Meteorite",
        "content": "All that's left for us to do... is to focus on our job."
